Measures: {{ JSON.stringify($json.dataset_meta.measures) }}
Time fields: {{ JSON.stringify($json.dataset_meta.time_fields) }}
Dataset context: {{ $json.dataset_context }}

Generate KPIs and business insights. ALL field references must come from the dimensions/measures/time_fields lists above.

KPI schema (max 8, no duplicate titles):
{
  "kpi_id": "kpi_001",
  "title": "Total Revenue",
  "field": "revenue",
  "aggregation": "sum",
  "format": "currency",
  "prefix": "$",
  "suffix": "",
  "business_meaning": "Total revenue in selected period",
  "target_audiences": ["top_management", "c_suite"]
}
aggregation options: sum | avg | count | count_distinct | min | max | median
format options: number | currency | percentage | duration
target_audiences options: end_users | middle_management | top_management | c_suite

Insight schema (max 16, no duplicate titles):
{
  "insight_id": "ins_001",
  "title": "Revenue Concentration by Region",
  "business_meaning": "Top 3 regions drive 72% of revenue",
  "required_fields": ["revenue", "region"],
  "calculation_logic": "Group by region, rank descending, compute top-3 share",
  "confidence_score": 0.9,
  "target_audience": "top_management",
  "business_impact_score": 9
}
business_impact_score: 1-10 integer

Return this exact JSON shape:
{
  "kpis": [...],
  "insights": [...]
}

